      "language": "english",
      "review": "Legitimately the greatest city builder/colony sim I've ever played. Seems hard to understand at first but very rewarding to figure out and realistically easier than the UI makes it look. Has a level of detail that all other city builders lack while being less character focused than a game like Rimworld. Fits a very specific niche that I adore. Also has Total War style battles, which are low key just a bonus. One of my favorite games ever made.",
      "timestamp_created": 1778530465,
      "timestamp_updated": 1778530465,
      "voted_up": true,
